<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1589973470 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">20 May 2020 11:17</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00221/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个████牌头戴式耳机，在被人用来听歌时，使用者会不自觉地唱出正在听的歌<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Dr.pigeon的办公室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被放置于Site-██低价值异常物品收容室中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>I want something just like this～Oh, I want something just like this～</em>——正在使用项目听歌的Dr.pigeon<br />
<em>Oh,I want something just he stop！</em>——被Dr.pigeon的歌声折磨到崩溃的特工fan</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00221" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00221" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00221-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609532381" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1590676061 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 May 2020 14:27</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00278/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一块型号不明的手机电池，当所处空间温度超过30℃时，该项目会迅速膨胀到汽车安全气囊的大小。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site23东侧的手机修理店<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>保存于Site23的低风险异常项目仓库中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>“一名女士跟我说手机的安全气囊弹出来了，当时我还不信。”——潜伏于手机修理店的邢特工</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00278" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00278" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00278-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ginger249-jackie" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4136896); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4136896&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609532381" alt="Ginger249-Jackie" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4136896)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ginger249-jackie" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4136896); return false;">Ginger249-Jackie</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1592710114 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">21 Jun 2020 03:28</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00062/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一份原出版日期未知的《人民日报》，其上所印刷的出版日期会随现实世界中日期实时变化，且该项目上所印刷的新闻内容会在印刷日期发生变化后自动替换为当天所印刷的《人民日报》刊载的内容。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2019/2/13<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Dr.Jackson于Site-CN-34附近一报刊亭中购得（在随后对该报刊亭的突击搜查中未发现与该项目具有类似异常性质的报刊）<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>于Site-CN-34员工休息室报刊架上<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>我就想给报刊架上点新货，这下可好，以后再也不用换报纸了</em>——Dr.Jackson<br />
<em>其实这根本没必要，那些报纸不知道多久没人去碰过了</em>——研究员李██</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00062" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00062" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00062-hovertip">
